    body: '<p>A <b>class</b> bundles data and the functions that work on it. Calling the class makes an <b>object</b>. <code>__init__</code> runs when the object is created and sets up its data. <code>self</code> means "this object", so <code>self.name</code> is data that belongs to it.</p>',
