    task: 'Write <code>fizzbuzz(n)</code>. Return <code>"FizzBuzz"</code> if n divides by 3 and 5, <code>"Fizz"</code> if by 3 only, <code>"Buzz"</code> if by 5 only, otherwise n as text (like <code>"7"</code>).',
    starter: 'function fizzbuzz(n) {\n  \n}\n',
