    body: '<p>Strings have many built-in tools. <code>.split()</code> breaks text into a list of words, <code>" ".join(words)</code> glues a list back together, <code>.strip()</code> removes spaces from the ends, and <code>.replace(a, b)</code> swaps text.</p><p><b>Slicing</b> copies a piece: <code>s[1:4]</code> is characters 1 to 3, and <code>s[::-1]</code> is the whole string <b>reversed</b>. Methods can be chained: <code>s.strip().lower()</code>.</p>',
